# Conventions in AGENTS.md / .agent-locks.md rely on agents cooperating; this file
# does not. Combined with branch protection ("require review from Code Owners"),
# nothing merges without a human seeing it, and an out-of-lane PR is visible
# BEFORE it lands rather than after.

# Default: everything needs review.
